### Backend API Documentation
### Base URL: http://localhost:5000

### ============================================================
### AUTHENTICATION & CSRF
### ============================================================

### 1. Get CSRF Token (Required for POST/PUT/DELETE)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/xxdf

### 2. Login with Google
GET http://localhost:5000/auth/google

### 3. Login with Email
POST http://localhost:5000/auth/email
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "password123"
}

### 4. Logout
GET http://localhost:5000/logout

### ============================================================
### USER MANAGEMENT
### ============================================================

### 5. Get Current User Profile
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/user
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 6. Get All Users (Super Admin & Admin only)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/user/all
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

### 7. Create New User (Super Admin & Admin only)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/user/add
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "john_doe",
  "email": "john@example.com",
  "password": "securePassword123",
  "roles": "kasir",
  "avatar_url": "https://example.com/avatar.jpg"
}

### 8. Update User (Super Admin can update anyone, others can only update themselves)
PUT http://localhost:5000/api/v1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "username": "john_doe_updated",
  "email": "newemail@example.com",
  "password": "newPassword123",
  "avatar_url": "https://example.com/newavatarr.jpg",
  "roles": "admin",
  "status_verified": "verified"
}

### 9. Update User Verification Status (Admin & Super Admin only)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/user/1/status-verified
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

{
  "status_verified": "verified"
}

### 10. Delete User (Super Admin & Admin can delete kasir)
DELETE http://localhost:5000/api/v1/user/1
Content-Type: application/json
X-CSRF-Token: {{csrfToken}}

